{c: Verse 1}
[A]Jab chali thadi hawa,
[A]jab uthi kaali ghataa
[E]Mujhako [D]ai jaan-e-wafaa
[E]tum [A]yaad aaye
[A]Zindagi ki daastaa,
[A]chaahe kitani [D]ho hasi
[A]Bin tumhaare kuchh nahi,
[A]bin tumhaare kuchh nahi
[A]Kyaa mazaa aataa sanam,
[A]aaj [D]bhulese kahi
[A]Tum bhi aajaate yahi,
[A]tum bhi aajaate yahi
[A]Ye bahaare ye fizaa,
[A]dekhakar o dilarubaa
[E]Jaane kyaa [D]dil ko huaa,
[E]tum [A]yaad aaye
[A]Ye nazaare ye samaa,
[A]aur phir [D]itane jawan
[A]Haaye re ye mastiyaan,
[A]haaye re ye mastiyaan
[A]Aisaa lagataa hai mujhe,
[A]jaise tum [D]nazadik ho
[A]Is chaman se jaan-e-jaa,
[A]is chaman se jaan-e-jaa
[A]Sun ke usaki sadaa,
[A]dil dhadakataa hai meraa
[E]Aaj [D]pahalese siva
